# Issue #787: the reporter-position alias path when the call is over-applied. `define forward`
# takes a built-in name, so phase-1 registration raises `ol-reserved-word` and the program halts
# before the reporter is evaluated: the event stream is empty and no `ol-too-many-inputs` is
# produced. Re-legalise `define forward` and this fixture reddens.
define forward
  return 55
end
print (fd 1 2)
